cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, please cite it using the following metadata.
title: 'Efflora HarmonyOS Bench: Benchmarking Coding Agents on HarmonyOS App Development'
authors:
  - name: Efflora
type: software
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Equality-Machine/efflora-harmonyos-bench'
abstract: >-
  An open-source benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on end-to-end
  HarmonyOS app development. Tasks are built from real open-source HarmonyOS
  projects pinned to specific commits, cover feature implementation, bug
  fixing, and spec-driven development, and are verified by building the app
  and running hidden unit and emulator UI tests. All tasks use the Harbor
  task format.
keywords:
  - harmonyos
  - arkts
  - arkui
  - benchmark
  - coding-agent
  - llm-evaluation
license: Apache-2.0
